  m_text: "\xB7 Age: 66.\r\n\r\n\xB7 The victim\u2019s wife.\r\n\r\n\xB7 Had an argument
    with the victim about infidelity.\r\n\r\n\xB7 Wandered around the building.\r\n\r\n\xB7
    Inconsistent and mentally unstable.\n\n\xB7 Mentions other people (Lily and the
    \u201Cbad girl\u201D he cheated with)."
